  "description": "Ideally located in Dublin’s Central Business District, The Residence Coopers Cross is a stunning development of brand-new apartments available to rent. The Residence Cooper Cross boasts an exceptional collection of Studios, 1, 2 and 3-bedroom homes in Dublin’s newest urban quarter. \r\n\r\nThe apartments are spacious and beautifully designed, focusing on the important elements of apartment living.  The clean and simple design of these generously proportioned apartments gives a light and airy feel to every home. The apartments are finished to an extremely high specification and some of these features include: \r\n\r\n•\tFloor to ceiling windows\r\n•\tLarge balconies \r\n•\tDesigner fit out \r\n•\tLuxury bathrooms and en-suites \r\n•\t“Nordmende” appliances\r\n•\tGenerous storage areas\r\n•\tIntegrated kitchens \r\n•\tUtility room with storage \r\n•\tUnderground parking available \r\n•\tSecure bicycle storage\r\n•\tExcellent energy rating A2-A3\r\n•\tPet friendly apartments \r\n•\tResident's App \r\n\r\nResidents will benefit from an unmatched range of exclusive amenities, with an on-site management suite and concierge service.  The amenities space includes:\r\n\r\n•\tManagement Team \r\n•\tConcierge Service\r\n•\tCo-Working Suite\r\n•\tMeeting Rooms\r\n•\tFocus Booths \r\n•\tLandscaped Rooftop Terraces \r\n•\tCommunity Lounge \r\n•\tResidents’ Kitchen\r\n•\tGame Zone\r\n•\tChildrens Play Den\r\n•\tConsole Room\r\n•\tChildrens Playground\r\n•\tMyPup (complimentary Parcel Collection Service) \r\n•\t1 Acre of Community Green Space and Courtyards\r\n•\tResidents’ private gym\r\n•\tPet Wash Station\r\n•\tRegular community events for residents\r\n\r\nLocated in Dublin’s central location of the North Docks, The Residence Coopers Cross is ideally situated for anyone looking to live in Dublin’s City Centre. Key employment hubs are located on the North and South of the docks with Dublin City now seen as one of Ireland’s leading tech locations. The North Docks is also home to an array of eateries, music venues, historic tales, and a flourishing community culture. \r\n\r\nIt is also perfectly positioned beside numerous transport options that include: \r\n\r\n•\tLuas Red Line – 1 Min Walk \r\n•\tDocklands Rail Station – 5 Min Walk\r\n•\tDublin Bikes – 1 Min Walk\r\n•\tDublin Bus – 2 Min Walk\r\n•\tDublin Airport – 15 Min Drive  \r\n\r\nFor more information on what The Residence Coopers Cross can offer you, contact us today and arrange a viewing.\r\n\r\nPlease note that all imagery and floor plans are indicative of a typical unit and are for illustrative purposes only.",
